                                        <td class="p-4 font-mono text-weaver-faded text-xs">env only</td>
                                        <td class="p-4 text-weaver-indigo/80">Override the executable path for the built-in <code>rust-analyzer</code> integration used for Rust semantic operations.</td>
                                    </tr>
